  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Emergency Health Response across the Gaza Strip 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ltpgtThrough this project, WHO will procure essential medicines, consumables and medical equipment to support five primary care centers and five hospitals, in Gaza City, Deir Al-Balah, and Khan Younis.&#xa0;A total of&#xa0;160,000&#xa0;patients attending to the targeted facilities,&#xa0;including 83,840 females, 76,160 children, and around 8,000 people with disability, are expected to&#xa0;benefit from the proposed activity.lt/pgt</narrative>
  </description>
